937:| `verification.k` | 9-13 | ordinary-rule | `-` | VALID_DEFINITIONAL_ALLINTS | `rule allInts(vCons(V:Val, R:ValSeq)) => isInt(V) andBool allInts(R) // Append the alternating leftmost/rightmost elements from S[L..R] to A. // The three guards partition all integer bounds, and recursive calls shrink // R - L by two.` |
