+    1 |-> list(vCons(1, vCons(1, .ValSeq)))
+  </heap>
+The destination demanded the original list [1, 2].
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
+rewritten further.
+body_sensitivity_kprove_exit=1

