+
+COMMAND:
+kprove 06_mutations.k --definition verification-fresh-kompiled --spec-module AUDIT-BODY-SENSITIVITY --dry-run --output none
+EXIT: 0
+OUTPUT: body_sensitivity_dry_run_exit=0
+
+COMMAND:
+kprove 06_mutations.k --definition verification-fresh-kompiled --spec-module AUDIT-BODY-SENSITIVITY
+EXIT: 1
+RELEVANT OUTPUT:
+Warning (WarnStuckClaimState):
+  The configuration's term doesn't unify with the destination's term and the
+  configuration cannot be rewritten further.
+The closure body in this claim changes the second append index from `right` to
+`left`. Its actual residual is:
+  <k> ref(1) ~> .K </k>
+  <heap>
+    0 |-> list(vCons(1, vCons(2, .ValSeq)))
+    1 |-> list(vCons(1, vCons(1, .ValSeq)))
+  </heap>
+The destination demanded the original list [1, 2].
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
+rewritten further.
+body_sensitivity_kprove_exit=1

